<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayyyy... yoooou a rookie, ain’t’cha?\nI can... I can tell. *hic*\rS’all good! Errbody... errbody\nwas a rookie. Even me. In ’82.\rIf you want... I’ll show you\naround. *burp* Ya feel me?\fAight! Follow... follow the OG!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ohhh... my bad, my bad...\nI forgot you... you ain’t got\fno Runnin’ Shoes. *hic*\rI’ma go reeeal slow... I can’t\ngo fast anyway. Keep up!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thiiis... this the Trap House.\nThey fix your homies up quick.\rI come here for... reasons.\nYou gon’ be here a lot. Like me.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the Corner Store.\nThey sell Hood Balls for recruitin’\fhomies and... and loosies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Route 30... it’s... that way.\nOr that way. One of them ways.\rPeople be out there\nscrappin’ with they homies.\rKeep goin’ an’ you’ll see\nMr. Pokémon’s spot. He cool.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Thas... thas the ocean.\nIt’s... it’s real big, bro. Real big.\rSome homies... only live in water.\nLike fish. Fish are... fish.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Heeeere...\nThis... this my crib!\rFor... for keepin’ up with me,\nI’ma give you my Runnin’ Shoes!\fThey still warm! *hic*\r...\n...\rGotcha! Hahaha...*cough cough*\nNah, they brand new. I stole ’em.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got the Runnin’ Shoes\nfrom the Guide Gent! They smell weird.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The tag say,\n“Tap the Sprint Button on the\fTouch Screen to sprint.”\rIt also say,\n“Hold the B Button down to sprint.”\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...Hhhff... hhhff...\nI made it... I’m dyin’...\rI forgot one thing.\nHere. Another... another gift.\rTake it. Before I lose it.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Guide Gent loaded the Map Card\non {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear! Barely.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Pokégear\ncan show the Town Map now!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Tap the Pokégear on the\nTouch Screen an’ then tap\fthe lil map thing.\rYou’ll see... the whole region.\nWhere you at. Where I’m at. Where?\rThe Pokégear get better when\nyou put more Cards in it.\rGood luck out there, youngblood!\nI’ma go lay down on the sidewalk.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rYou got a homie from the lab.\nWhat a waste.\rThat homie too good for\na lame like you.\r...\nYou ain’t get what I’m sayin’?\rI got a hard homie too.\nLemme show you!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">...\rYou wanna know who I am?\n...\rI’ma be the hardest\nhustler in the whole world.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Give it back!\nThat’s my ID!\rDamn!\nYou seen my name...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You talk to the OG by the\nTrap House? He... rough today.\rHe’ll put a Map of Johto on your\nPokégear. If he awake.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When you rollin’ with homies,\nevery block feel like home.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mr. Pokémon’s spot is still\nup ahead.\rYou could use some Runnin’ Shoes if\nyou had some.\rBut watch out for opps\nin the grass!\rWhen you run, the noise\nbring ’em out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ran up on the people on the road.\nMy homies got smoked.\rThey messed up! I gotta take ’em\nto the Trap House.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A homie I recruited had this on him.\nI think it’s Mystic Water.\rI don’t need it. You want it?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Back to fishin’, then.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You ain’t got room for this.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cherrygrove City\nThe City of Fragrant Corner Stores</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0550_T21_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Guide Gent’s Crib\nKnock Loud. He Sleep Hard.</language>
	</row>
</body>
